6" height="16" class="stroke-charcoal mt-1 min-w-[16px] absolute top-1/2 transform -translate-y-1/2 right-4 flex items-center" viewBox="0 0 15 9" data-testid="chevron-icon"><path fill="none" d="M1 0.999999L7 7L13 1" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div><div role="region" id="sect-:Rcprbjt95bpuuukva:" aria-labelledby=":Rcprbjt95bpuuukva:" class="collapse-content"><div class="pb-6 text-base text-left"><p class="leading-6 lg:leading-7 last:mb-0 mb-6 md:mb-8">Play Kits are delivered at the start of new developmental windows, for play that feels challenging and fun for months.</p></div></div></button><button id=":Rkprbjt95bpuuukva:" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="sect-:Rkprbjt95bpuuukva:" class="accordion collapse mx-auto border-t border-y-charcoal-opacity-20 md:container last:border-b w-full collapse-close" data-testid="accordion-collapse-button"><div class="collapse-title cursor-pointer py-6 text-base font-bold md:py-6 md:text-base md:text-lg relative"><p class="accordion-title text-left pr-12">Arrives every 2-3 months<!-- --> </p><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" class="stroke-charcoal mt-1 min-w-[16px] absolute top-1/2 transform -translate-y-1/2 right-4 flex items-center" viewBox="0 0 15 9" data-testid="chevron-icon"><path fill="none" d="M1 0.999999L7 7L13 1" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div><div role="region" id="sect-:Rkprbjt95bpuuukva:" aria-labelledby=":Rkprbjt95bpuuukva:" class="collapse-content"><div class="pb-6 text-base text-left"><p class="leading-6 lg:leading-7 last:mb-0 mb-6 md:mb-8">Toy rotation is easy with new playthings that complement the playthings you already have.</p></div></div></button><button id=":Rsprbjt95bpuuukva:" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="sect-:Rsprbjt95bpuuukva:" class="accordion collapse mx-auto border-t border-y-charcoal-opacity-20 md:container last:border